{
  "name": "Blackguard's Escape",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have the ability to slip away from your foes. Immediately after you are hit by an attack, you can use your Reaction to turn Invisible and teleport up to 60 feet to a spot you can see. You remain Invisible until the end of your next turn or until you attack, deal damage, or force a creature to make a Saving Throw. Once you use this feature, you must finish a Short or a Long Rest before you can use it again.</p>",
